WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.100
You did not throw away
the flyer.

00:03.100 --> 00:05.480
I'm glad you kept it,

00:05.480 --> 00:07.450
because that probably
means there is something

00:07.450 --> 00:09.520
about Jiu-Jitsu that
caught your attention.

00:09.520 --> 00:12.200
I know starting something
new can feel hard.

00:12.200 --> 00:14.920
Especially when it involves
physical contact.

00:14.920 --> 00:18.200
But let me help make
this part easier.

00:18.200 --> 00:21.300
My name is Joao Crus.
I have been teaching

00:21.300 --> 00:24.480
Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu
since 2003.

00:24.480 --> 00:28.000
I trained with
Carlson Gracie and

00:28.000 --> 00:31.340
Ricardo De La Riva.
Now, here in Texas,

00:31.340 --> 00:34.100
I help children and adults
grow stronger,

00:34.100 --> 00:37.040
more confident, and more
capable.

00:37.040 --> 00:40.100
Whether your concern is
bullying, fitness,

00:40.100 --> 00:42.120
focus, or simply
trying something new,

00:42.120 --> 00:44.880
you are in the right place.

00:44.880 --> 00:47.000
At our academy, you will
find a safe, welcoming

00:47.000 --> 00:49.640
environment for kids, adults,
and complete beginners,

00:49.640 --> 00:53.000
built on discipline, respect,
and confidence.

00:53.000 --> 00:55.660
Our approach is simple:

00:55.660 --> 00:58.200
We improve one percent
every day.

00:58.200 --> 01:01.500
Jiu-Jitsu teaches far more
than self-defense.

01:01.500 --> 01:04.500
It builds mental strength
and helps you face challenges.

01:04.500 --> 01:07.280
It helps you stay calm
under pressure.

01:07.280 --> 01:10.100
If something in that flyer
spoke to you,

01:10.100 --> 01:13.200
don't wait.

01:13.200 --> 01:15.200
It may have been meant
to reach you

01:15.200 --> 01:17.300
at exactly the right time.
